<title>JAPAN: Vitec corrects 1996/97 diluted earnings per share.</title>
<headline>Vitec corrects 1996/97 diluted earnings per share.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vitec Co Ltd on Tuesday corrected its diluted earnings per share for the year to March 31, 1997 to 37.17 yen, versus 39.95 yen announced on May 20.</p>
</text>
